  <body>
  
    <section>
    
      <p class="section-title">Messaging Compliance</p>
      <h1 class="section-heading">SMS Consent & Opt-In Process</h1>
      
      <p>
      This page documents how customers provide consent to receive SMS messages from
      <strong>Upskilled Consulting</strong>.
      </p>
      
      <h3>How Consent Is Collected</h3>
      
      <p>
      Customers provide consent to receive SMS messages when they request services
      through our website or communicate with our team. During this interaction,
      users are informed that SMS messages may be used to respond to their request
      or provide updates related to their inquiry.
      </p>
      
      <h3>Consent Language</h3>
      
      <p>
      Users are presented with the following disclosure before agreeing to receive messages:
      </p>
      
      <blockquote>
      I consent to receive SMS messages from Upskilled Consulting regarding my inquiry or services.
      Message frequency may vary. Message and data rates may apply.
      Reply STOP to unsubscribe or HELP for assistance.
      </blockquote>
      
      <h3>Message Details</h3>
      
      <ul>
        <li>Message frequency varies depending on the interaction.</li>
        <li>Standard message and data rates may apply.</li>
        <li>Users may reply <strong>STOP</strong> to opt out at any time.</li>
        <li>Users may reply <strong>HELP</strong> for support.</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h3>Contact</h3>
      
      <p>
      For questions about messaging, contact us at:
      <strong>get@upskilled.consulting</strong>
      </p>
      
    </section>
    
  </body>
